      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Delightful 4 bed detached family residence on c. 0.5-acre site with mature gardens.\r\n   \r\nPresented in immaculate condition, this impressive family residence extends to approximately 242 sq.m and offers bright, exceptionally spacious accommodation ideal for a growing family.\r\n\r\nInside, the home features an abundance of well proportioned living space, including a generous living room, an expansive dual aspect kitchen/dining area, a utility room, office, guest WC and a welcoming entrance hall. Upstairs, the sense of light and space continues with four sizeable double bedrooms, two of which benefit from modern en suite shower rooms. The main bedroom further features a walk in wardrobe providing excellent storage solutions, while a large family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is set on a beautifully mature site framed by established trees and planting. A tarmacadam driveway leads to the front of the home, offering ample parking. \r\nTo the rear, a substantial granite slab patio provides an ideal outdoor entertaining space, complemented by a terraced garden and two greenhouses\r\nThe property is further enhanced by its prime location, giving access to the M11 and Gorey and a wide variety of recreational facilities and clubs and exceptional beaches. \r\n\r\nThe property is further enhanced by its prime location that offers easy access to the M11, Gorey town, an array of recreational amenities and clubs, and several exceptional beaches, making this an outstanding opportunity for those seeking space, convenience, and quality in equal measures."
      },
